 ],
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Being busy is the laziest thing you will ever do.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.202,
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 9
  },
  {
   "text": "I know.",
   "start": 3.753,
   "end": 4.225,
   "w0": 10,
   "w1": 11
  },
  {
   "text": "You worked twelve hours today.",
   "start": 4.689,
   "end": 6.099,
   "w0": 12,
   "w1": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty-seven emails.",
   "start": 6.457,
   "end": 7.525,
   "w0": 17,
   "w1": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "Six meetings.",
   "start": 7.525,
   "end": 8.677,
   "w0": 19,
   "w1": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "You're exhausted.",
   "start": 9.123,
   "end": 10.016,
   "w0": 21,
   "w1": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "But be honest.",
   "start": 10.513,
   "end": 11.21,
   "w0": 23,
   "w1": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "What actually moved?",
   "start": 11.583,
   "end": 12.835,
   "w0": 26,
   "w1": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the ugly truth.",
   "start": 13.434,
   "end": 14.548,
   "w0": 29,
   "w1": 32
  },
  {
   "text": "Busy is where smart people hide.",
   "start": 14.905,
   "end": 16.975,
   "w0": 33,
   "w1": 38
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time you check your phone, your brain can need over twenty minutes to fully lock back in.",
   "start": 17.495,
   "end": 21.983,
   "w0": 39,
   "w1": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "Do that ten times a day...",
   "start": 22.476,
   "end": 23.755,
   "w0": 57,
   "w1": 62
  },
  {
   "text": "and the real work never even starts.",
   "start": 23.978,
   "end": 25.884,
   "w0": 63,
   "w1": 69
  },
  {
   "text": "So you do the easy stuff.",
   "start": 26.356,
   "end": 27.55,
   "w0": 70,
   "w1": 75
  },
  {
   "text": "Fast.",
   "start": 27.866,
   "end": 28.394,
   "w0": 76,
   "w1": 76
  },
  {
   "text": "Loud.",
   "start": 28.581,
   "end": 29.056,
   "w0": 77,
   "w1": 77
  },
  {
   "text": "All day.",
   "start": 29.338,
   "end": 29.889,
   "w0": 78,
   "w1": 79
  },
  {
   "text": "Because easy stuff can never tell you that you failed.",
   "start": 30.301,
   "end": 32.755,
   "w0": 80,
   "w1": 89
  },
  {
   "text": "Meanwhile, someone else does one hard thing.",
   "start": 33.224,
   "end": 35.713,
   "w0": 90,
   "w1": 96
  },
  {
   "text": "Ninety minutes.",
   "start": 36.052,
   "end": 36.832,
   "w0": 97,
   "w1": 98
  },
  {
   "text": "Phone in another room.",
   "start": 37.094,
   "end": 38.104,
   "w0": 99,
   "w1": 102
  },
  {
   "text": "One year later...",
   "start": 38.473,
   "end": 39.31,
   "w0": 103,
   "w1": 105
  },
  {
   "text": "guess who's ahead.",
   "start": 39.681,
   "end": 40.441,
   "w0": 106,
   "w1": 108
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the twist.",
   "start": 40.914,
   "end": 41.794,
   "w0": 109,
   "w1": 111
  },
  {
   "text": "They're not two people.",
   "start": 42.28,
   "end": 43.205,
   "w0": 112,
   "w1": 115
  },
  {
   "text": "They're both you.",
   "start": 43.575,
   "end": 44.344,
   "w0": 116,
   "w1": 118
  },
  {
   "text": "And every morning, you pick which one shows up.",
   "start": 44.766,
   "end": 47.142,
   "w0": 119,
   "w1": 127
  },
  {
   "text": "So tomorrow, before one email, one message, one meeting...",
   "start": 47.58,
   "end": 51.036,
   "w0": 128,
   "w1": 136
  },
  {
   "text": "do the thing you've been avoiding.",
   "start": 51.308,
   "end": 52.643,
   "w0": 137,
   "w1": 142
  },
  {
   "text": "Because if you don't, you'll stay busy.",
   "start": 52.977,
   "end": 54.972,
   "w0": 143,
   "w1": 149
  },
  {
   "text": "And being busy...",
   "start": 55.335,
   "end": 56.16,
   "w0": 150,
   "w1": 152
  },
  {
   "text": "is the laziest thing you will ever do.",
   "start": 56.423,
   "end": 58.697,
   "w0": 153,
   "w1": 160
  }
 ]
}